      "metadata": {
        "title": "Data management plan",
        "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.4249121",
        "publication_date": "2020-11-06",
        "description": "<p>EO4AGRI Project participates in the Open Research Data Pilot (ORD pilot) launched by the European Commission along with the Horizon 2020 programme. The main target of the ORD pilot is to improve and maximise access to research data generated by a project and to achieve it is mandatory to define a Data Management Plan (DMP)<br>\nThis document is the deliverable D1.5 Data Management Plan v1 and it provides a general outline of the project policy for data management. The overall purpose of this DMP is to provide an analysis of the main elements of the data management policy that will be used by the project.</p>",
